-- Ohio Medical / GCE text corrections (owner 2026-11-12): spelling fixed, official GCE product pages linked, RS-00616 named as GCE lists it.
-- Adds the PRIVATE catalog record (NO prices — every commercial field empty) for the corrected ohio-medical.json. The earlier
-- record stays (history); the storefront uses the record whose identity matches the deployed file. Inserts only if missing.
begin;
